---
// Refer & Earn — the self-sufficient growth loop. Referral pays 1% of every referred stake to the
// referrer's wallet on every resolve (win OR lose), taken from the house rake so it never reduces
// the player's payout. Self-referral is blocked on-chain (contract.py: REFERRAL_BPS=100, 1%).
// Static Astro — the personalized link is minted on the app after wallet connect; here we sell it.
---

<section class="referral-section relative overflow-hidden border-t border-stone-800 px-6 py-24">
  <div class="referral-glow" aria-hidden></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400">Refer &amp; Earn</h2>
      <span
        class="border border-amber-500/30 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-amber-400/70"
        >Live · on-chain</span
      >
    </div>

    <!-- Hook -->
    <p class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-amber-50/90 md:text-[2.6rem]" data-reveal>
      Every flip your crew makes pays
      <span class="pct-glow whitespace-nowrap text-amber-400">you 1%</span>. Forever.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-amber-400/55" data-reveal>
      No claim flow, no dashboard to babysit. The contract sends <strong class="text-amber-400/80"
        >1% of every referred stake</strong
      > straight to your wallet the moment a flip resolves — win or lose. It comes out of the house
      rake, so it never touches their payout.
    </p>

    <!-- 3-step -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="referral-card border border-amber-500/12 p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="step-num mb-3 font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-amber-400">01</div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold text-amber-400/90">Share your link</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-amber-400/50">
          <span class="font-mono text-amber-400/70">app.fairground.quest/?ref=&lt;you&gt;</span>.
          Every proof card you post already carries it as a scannable QR — sharing a win recruits for
          you automatically.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="referral-card border border-amber-500/12 p-6" data-reveal style="--d: 0.08s">
        <div class="step-num mb-3 font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-amber-400">02</div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold text-amber-400/90">They flip</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-amber-400/50">
          Win or lose doesn't matter — every resolved flip counts. The 1% is skimmed from the house's
          cut, never from their stake, so there's nothing for them to lose by using your link.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="referral-card border border-amber-500/12 p-6" data-reveal style="--d: 0.16s">
        <div class="step-num mb-3 font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-amber-400">03</div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold text-amber-400/90">You earn</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-amber-400/50">
          The contract pays your wallet on every resolve, on-chain, instantly. Nothing to claim,
          nothing to trust — it's an inner transaction you can read in the explorer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA + proof note -->
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-start gap-4" data-reveal>
      <a
        href="https://app.fairground.quest"
        class="fg-conic inline-block px-8 py-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-amber-400 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80"
      >
        [ Get your referral link _ ]
      </a>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-amber-400/35">
        Fixed 1% (REFERRAL_BPS = 100) · self-referral blocked on-chain · paid from house rake, not
        the player's bet
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
